# Line endings are LF in every checkout, Windows included. The audit floor records the
# sha of audit.py's BYTES: checked out with CRLF - Git for Windows' default - the same
# auditor hashed 66812c66 instead of 4a8e3593, and a floor set on one machine refused
# to compare on another. Measured on a Windows runner, 2026-09-24.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
